    {
      "text": "Melt the margarine with the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir the cabbage in the margarine until soft, about 5 minutes; season with salt, pepper, and garlic powder. Add the mushrooms; continue cooking, stirring frequently, until mushrooms are tender.",
